{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "nf967ptx8zenqr1e", "title": "151.Dify基于视觉模型实现多票据识别", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"VPQp8\" id=\"VPQp8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9544b92\" id=\"ud9544b92\">课程内容</span></h2><ol list=\"u7d432d6a\"><li fid=\"u046956eb\" data-lake-id=\"u4687e618\" id=\"u4687e618\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94be0fe3\" id=\"u94be0fe3\">创建多票据识别工作流</span></li><li fid=\"u046956eb\" data-lake-id=\"ua5b319dd\" id=\"ua5b319dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3d82840\" id=\"uc3d82840\">执行票据文档提取</span></li><li fid=\"u046956eb\" data-lake-id=\"u3d55d701\" id=\"u3d55d701\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua42b6d46\" id=\"ua42b6d46\">多模态大模型识别票据内容</span></li><li fid=\"u046956eb\" data-lake-id=\"ubb38c21b\" id=\"ubb38c21b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u373b1a9f\" id=\"u373b1a9f\">变量聚合器和直接回复</span></li><li fid=\"u046956eb\" data-lake-id=\"ue828a1c5\" id=\"ue828a1c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u949ad778\" id=\"u949ad778\">Chatflow调试及发布</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u959c5118\" id=\"u959c5118\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud89c39b8\" id=\"ud89c39b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua840dde9\" id=\"ua840dde9\">本次我们实现多种发票识别的dify基于工作流的智能体</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc21f391f\" id=\"uc21f391f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6095db52\" id=\"u6095db52\">下面我们首先介绍一下整体功能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u33c23d3f\" id=\"u33c23d3f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235790214-f1b62bdb-3860-4495-b1ef-31465d56d714.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u46a5f4ce-9490-45b7-8353-20bbb177715%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1696%2C%22originHeight%22%3A837%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eff1f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8be4aee6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud6b2a483\" id=\"ud6b2a483\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16dc4c7e\" id=\"u16dc4c7e\"> 这里面主要功能：用户上传一个发票图片（目前我们这工作流支持6种发票），发票会经过文档提取器。文档提取器提取用户上传的发票传递给llm多模态模型，这个模型的作用是判断这发票是哪个类型的发票，接下来我们会根据条件分支来判断走哪个多模态发票提取的llm大语言模型。 其中这6个大语言模型区别就在于他们的系统提示词不一样，主要就是每个发票票面信息不一样。模型会根据不同发票票面信息提示词的不同而有所区别，模型返回的json格式的发票信息在发送给变量聚合器进行出来，处理完成后再发送给用户，整体的功能大概就是这样的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7852fd73\" id=\"u7852fd73\"><span data-lake-id=\"u415c6176\" id=\"u415c6176\">实现的效果如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucef06ded\" id=\"ucef06ded\"><span data-lake-id=\"u896ff734\" id=\"u896ff734\">1 火车票票面识别</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub33113a9\" id=\"ub33113a9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238506906-030049a0-31c8-4d4d-b8d8-f43f0cfad083.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u488dba7e-1ebf-4eef-a189-105f90e34ae%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A366.6666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A603%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A349532%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A550%2C%22originHeight%22%3A904%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d6dee1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uedd47376%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f650cea\" id=\"u6f650cea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10010e98\" id=\"u10010e98\">2.加油站卷式发票</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u17c3ee78\" id=\"u17c3ee78\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238525254-32fa48ee-870d-49f1-afb5-96fd5ff19016.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubc9bee9e-a140-483c-9683-f61960d001d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A406%2C%22height%22%3A623%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A257540%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A609%2C%22originHeight%22%3A934%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d4d6d4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud8cac0cc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u08596cfa\" id=\"u08596cfa\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad0128d7\" id=\"uad0128d7\">下面我们重点介绍一下这个工作流是如何实现的。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"05b85f2e\" id=\"05b85f2e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d982a5f\" id=\"u9d982a5f\">创建工作流或者chatflow</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4ace388f\" id=\"u4ace388f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a369cf5\" id=\"u3a369cf5\">接着来到Dify中按下图顺序依次点击并点击创建(注：chatflow和工作流配置基本差不多，下面我们就以chatflow讲解)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3a95e031\" id=\"u3a95e031\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238541048-573f6a3e-08f7-4957-8e6a-176e1f72a5c5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0e011149-09aa-4f40-924d-78f64d1cf2c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1264.6666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A614%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A249409%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1897%2C%22originHeight%22%3A921%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bebfb9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uba804f20%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"a3e3b883\" id=\"a3e3b883\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16cfd4b0\" id=\"u16cfd4b0\">开始</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6c367512\" id=\"u6c367512\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua389af9b\" id=\"ua389af9b\"> 开始节点点开后我们需要添加一个文件上传输入参数。点击开始节点输入字段，点击右边的“+”</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u27620d0a\" id=\"u27620d0a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238564244-35686332-799d-4caa-866b-c4f03b29696f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u79ba7ca1-f2e4-4ba7-baa4-7e092eebabd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1296.6666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A619%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A329742%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1945%2C%22originHeight%22%3A928%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a2a6a3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u759dfe7d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u005bcd1d\" id=\"u005bcd1d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2997411a\" id=\"u2997411a\"> 我们选择单个文件，输入变量名称、支持的文件类型我们这里就选择图片。其他都可以默认，输入完成后，点击保存按钮</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u66776bb5\" id=\"u66776bb5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235791476-186990c5-e223-493a-a3be-ce9845d0da44.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u37e838cd-26e3-4423-82aa-91fac919720%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A974%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1539%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23aeb1a4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u11c34dfd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0da7bb2c\" id=\"u0da7bb2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cff2f0f\" id=\"u3cff2f0f\">以上步骤完成开始节点设置。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf73779a9\" id=\"uf73779a9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238593654-cb26d7a9-f9d5-4de1-a319-f6adae8b3599.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc898abf3-c22a-44c8-81cd-e059f899b44%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1246%2C%22height%22%3A611%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A279220%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1869%2C%22originHeight%22%3A916%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e3eaee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufb5b8715%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"d075b9b9\" id=\"d075b9b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8558c745\" id=\"u8558c745\">文档提取器</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc49adf3d\" id=\"uc49adf3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u271771f0\" id=\"u271771f0\"> 接下来我们在工作流画布中，选择文档提取器和开始节点连接，去掉llm和开始节点连接</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua66946dc\" id=\"ua66946dc\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235792572-67f8dc94-0bab-4b44-a4b4-722c63b02048.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6fe1fac2-8739-44f9-ba62-2b5b1245943%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1879%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1423%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c5e0dd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaeb46ff3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u86ab0acb\" id=\"u86ab0acb\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235793031-06e24e26-b214-45ec-b301-8bbbad61a235.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc7b47ceb-a39b-4c97-a89e-859c5f11ae7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2842%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1410%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d0e5de%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u68a8c1c7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc0c75826\" id=\"uc0c75826\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9bac594\" id=\"uc9bac594\"> 我们在文档提取器，输入变量中选中 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udecb3731\" id=\"udecb3731\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4494319c\" id=\"u4494319c\">sys.files</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u62ac5960\" id=\"u62ac5960\"> 变量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7ebf5fec\" id=\"u7ebf5fec\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238608607-289178e7-60e7-41d4-a034-cb11edb86616.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue7407e1d-c849-4e19-a95a-1d159d13810%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1250%2C%22height%22%3A612%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.pn