1'%E8%BD%A6%E5%8F%B7%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E5%B7%A5%E5%8F%B7%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E5%8D%95%E4%BB%B7%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E7%AD%89%E5%80%99%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%E2%80%99%E7%AD%89%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E4%BB%A5json%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T6T29%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u17563cb8\" id=\"u17563cb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u269c5a53\" id=\"u269c5a53\">如果需要在增加发票识别 可以根据上面操作步骤新增一个多模态识别模型以及编写 新的提示词即可。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"e1169137\" id=\"e1169137\"><span data-lake-id=\"u483e1e79\" id=\"u483e1e79\">变量聚合器</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u521c8b28\" id=\"u521c8b28\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4743b131\" id=\"u4743b131\"> 这个变量聚合器是干啥的呢？大家发现没有6个多模态发票识别的输出结构其实是一样的，只是它的内容有所区别。因为后面我们是需要输出给用户的，所以这里我们就用变量聚合器把llm大语言模型提取发票的结果统一输出到一个变量聚合器里面。它的配置也很简单接受上一个流程输出结果即可</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue2aaaa46\" id=\"ue2aaaa46\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238684364-0105aad3-dde2-414a-b45d-68fae998efbd.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue5fe758d-1824-4331-be31-5ef2ea28911%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A642%2C%22height%22%3A607%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A271616%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A963%2C%22originHeight%22%3A910%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9fafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u20b799f5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufc0fad19\" id=\"ufc0fad19\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3186a4be\" id=\"u3186a4be\"> 如果没有变量聚合器就会变成我之前配置的那个流程了，给大家看一下我之前的那个流程吧。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2c5624be\" id=\"u2c5624be\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235794534-75acc0e5-82df-453a-8fe6-740b396ac65b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u88b266cb-f9eb-4b1e-96f5-b4540bd3b87%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1540%2C%22originHeight%22%3A854%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eff1f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6cfc7ccd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"7ec0ae7c\" id=\"7ec0ae7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5662537\" id=\"ub5662537\">直接回复</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6b53656d\" id=\"u6b53656d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e6359b2\" id=\"u7e6359b2\">接下来我们将变量聚合器连接到直接回复的输出节点。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee9a5412\" id=\"uee9a5412\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua536ad25\" id=\"ua536ad25\"> 这个地方设置比较简单，在回复设置一下llm text文本输出以及 开始节点file 输出，这样设置后。就会将发票提取的票面信息以json格式的文本信息返回，并将上传的发票图片信息一并返回给用户</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u19422bc6\" id=\"u19422bc6\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235794588-ecbef695-66dc-45cf-87a1-55138b3bfdc8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u73429934-75fb-4b07-8511-3a4dc2a3e4a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A875%2C%22originHeight%22%3A787%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eab26e%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1256c01c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9e402a90\" id=\"u9e402a90\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f6b10b2\" id=\"u5f6b10b2\">通过以上方式我们就初步完成了整个chatflow工作流。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"4e211b63\" id=\"4e211b63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d332b37\" id=\"u0d332b37\">chatflow调试及发布</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u7d852c74\" id=\"u7d852c74\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f73f3bf\" id=\"u3f73f3bf\">完成以上配置后就可以点击调试及发布了</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u17c88f0a\" id=\"u17c88f0a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c8c066e\" id=\"u1c8c066e\">这里推荐大家使用硅基流动的提供的Qwen/Qwen2-VL-72B-Instruct模型，这个模型目前在上海人工智能实验室推出的CompassRank评测多模态大模型中排名第一</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub0ce740b\" id=\"ub0ce740b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235795297-ac6e2818-1d68-410b-8727-151e49cc525d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue52c773f-2880-4912-93dd-519a3660aae%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud11ea383-8b79-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1863%2C%22originHeight%22%3A823%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfdfd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XpGcO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2bcd050b\" id=\"u2bcd050b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2efaf906\" id=\"u2efaf906\"> 如果大家没有硅基流动的账号，可以点击</span><a href=\"https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/i/e0f6GCrN\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udfcec6bc\" id=\"udfcec6bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d8cf7cd\" id=\"u7d8cf7cd\">https://cloud.siliconflow.cn</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6b601dc2\" id=\"u6b601dc2\"> 地址来注册，目前硅基的政策是新户注册送14块钱，14块钱够玩一阵子了。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"83611abd\" id=\"83611abd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9743409\" id=\"uc9743409\">发布</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u2ce18743\" id=\"u2ce18743\"><span data-lake-id=\"u671e4e54\" id=\"u671e4e54\">点击工作流左上角发布按钮对外提供发布</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u598cfd45\" id=\"u598cfd45\" style=\"text-align: left\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238758293-064980e2-0818-4ccb-ba9c-45e89d8c5dfa.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uff2e82ca-8b46-4a23-8b23-760dec41ff8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd3dd04-0255-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A398%2C%22height%22%3A353%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A92206%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A597%2C%22originHeight%22%3A529%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e8eeed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u87fcc9d7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue22a54ab\" id=\"ue22a54ab\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc504b5c4\" id=\"uc504b5c4\">点击 start chat 就可以使用了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3c574174\" id=\"u3c574174\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238779967-251a299c-b